<div class="kcaz-q">
<p>1. What is the role of Azure ML Datastore in this project?</p>
<div class="kcaz-opts">
<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Stores model code</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Acts as a bridge between Azure ML Workspace and Storage Account</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Creates compute instances</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Stores GitHub credentials</label>
</div>
</div>

<div class="kcaz-q">
<p>2. Where is the NYC Taxi dataset stored?</p>
<div class="kcaz-opts">
<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Azure Key Vault</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Azure ML Workspace</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Azure Blob Storage Container</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> GitHub Repository</label>
</div>
</div>

