<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Azure Storage + GitHub Actions</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Azure Key Vault + Azure ML Datastore</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Azure ML Compute + VNet</label>
<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> Terraform + Blob Storage</label>
</div>
